secure-terminal-code-amber-name = Code Amber
secure-terminal-code-amber-desc = Escalates the station to [color=palevioletred]Amber[/color] alert.
    There is an immediate station ending threat. All crewmembers are to be armed by any means and all non-essential personnel must assist Security and the Heads of Staff in the defence of the station.
secure-terminal-code-gamma-announcement = Attention! Code Amber is being put into effect shortly. Martial law will be enforced. All crew report to your nearest head of staff immediately.

secure-terminal-end-amber-name = End Amber Alert
secure-terminal-end-amber-desc = Lifts [color=palevioletred]Amber[/color] alert and returns the station to Green. Requires Amber to have been active for at least 15 minutes.
secure-terminal-end-amber-announcement = Code Amber is being lifted. The station is being restored to normal operations. Return weapons to security and await further instruction from your head of staff.
